# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SoundFonts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .sf2 and .sf3 files are NOT ignored, so both can be committed.
# Beware: GitHub rejects any single file over 100 MB, and FluidR3_GM.sf2 is ~148 MB.
# Use the .sf3 version of large SoundFonts (see tools/Sf3Tool) if you want to push them.

